00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.269
and I just never saw him get in
or get out,

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:37.603
so I don't really know.

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:39.572
[ Laughter ]
Maybe there was help.

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:41.174
Maybe he had friends help him,
